# DCS build-time environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and customise the values for your local build.
# `.env` is gitignored so personal / project-secret values stay out of
# version control. The Makefile reads `.env` automatically when present.
#
# Precedence (highest wins):
#   1. make CLI override:           make DCS_BUILD_SALT=x cli
#   2. .env in repo root            <-- recommended for personal builds
#   3. Makefile default             dcs-default-salt
#
# NOTE: bash inline env-prefix (DCS_BUILD_SALT=x make ...) does NOT work
# on MSYS2 make. Use one of the three options above.

# Tamper-signature salt (R-15 part 3). Concatenated with version, date,
# and git short hash; SHA-256 of the result is embedded in the binary.
# Any value of your choice — the protection only matters if attackers
# don't know it. Keep this OUT of git for a real (modest) effect.
DCS_BUILD_SALT="change me here"
